codes in PHP, run on ur own server to test please.<br />
(or can ratt put this somewhere?)<br />
<br />
XP = level_of_mob^2 * ZEM * Level_Modifier * Party_Modifier<br />
<br />
AAXP = 80% of XP, (was on two class of my char - wis based both)<br />
<br />
ZEM = 75 : regular field<br />
           85 : regular dungeon<br />
