<br />
Level_Modifier = (260 - 13*(level - mob_level))/100<br />
<br />
Party_Modifier = mylevel+5 / (Total_Party_Level + 5*party_number) * group_bonus<br />
<br />
group_bonus = 1, 1.02, 1.06, 1.1, 1.14, 1.2 - for each party num<br />
