	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" >thanks all,<br />
<br />
but *WE* need more ZEM value I think. <img src="images/smilies/wink.gif" border="0" alt=""><br />
<br />
it is quite easy to calculate.<br />
<br />
1. do fresh login, and see your AA xp section.<br />
  there should be raw AA xp there. (it's true value) - (OldAA)<br />
  You can work with regular lvl XP, but AA is better to write down coz it do not move after logon. (and AAxp 100%)<br />
<br />
2. kill something, solo is better but group is not so bad. and get exp. You should write down level of mob which you take down.<br />
