<br />
5. use your favorite calculator,<br />
   (NewAA - OldAA) / RawAA =&gt; ZEM for that zone.<br />
<br />
<br />
(ex) You are 61th, and group with 60th.<br />
1. your OldAA is 8,470,070<br />
2. you killed 56lv mob.<br />
3. after relogin, NewAA was 8,834,604<br />
4. enter 61 on your level, and fill 60 on first slot of party,<br />
  you can see RawXP for 56 is 3142, and rawAA is 2513.6<br />
5. calculate,<br />
 ( 8,834,604 -  8,470,070 ) / 2513.6<br />
   = 145.02466581795035009548058561426<br />
<br />
so we can guess ZEM for this zone is 145. (and POST it here!!!) <img src="images/smilies/biggrin.gif" border="0" alt=""> <br />
<br />
I am not in even middle guild, so almost do not have keys/flags. so I need help of you to complete these ZEM.</font></p>
	
